 =?UTF-8?q?modes:=20Instant=20/=20Medium=20/=20High?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the Fast/Thinking + effort matrix with the three modes the owner
asked for (4th ask). Instant = fast mode; Medium/High = thinking with that
effort — same per-turn switches the agent already honors, no model names
shown. High's description carries the honest cost note (slower, uses more
of the daily allowance). Composer pill shows the active mode name.
(When per-turn model plumbing lands, High additionally routes pro/max to
the premium model — server plan-gate already live.)
